-- On the kernel: the echo performed with its responses written to descriptor 3
-- (udp-echo-rec-run.cub on the net, udp-echo-rec-build.cub as build/udp-echo-rec; run either
-- with 3>build/udp-echo.log), and the process run again from that log on descriptor 0
-- (udp-echo-replay-run.cub, with <build/udp-echo.log): the outcome and the responses left over
udp-echo-rec-step : Step W (Sum Errno Word)
udp-echo-rec-step = linux-step-rec {Sum Errno Word} (x86-64-linux #2) (x86-64-linux-le #2) #3 (udp-echo {lzero})
